From e51834f7fc33b10aee082c4614dc4782b191f4da Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alfred Wingate <parona@protonmail.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 05:57:49 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Update resolv to 0.7.2

"""
No release is planned for the 0.2.x line that the Ruby 3.2 series ships, because that series has reached its end of life. Install resolv 0.7.2 there instead.
"""

See-Also: https://www.ruby-lang.org/en/news/2026/08/27/multiple-vulnerabilities-in-resolv/
Signed-off-by: Alfred Wingate <parona@protonmail.com>
--- a/ext/win32/resolv/extconf.rb
+++ b/ext/win32/resolv/extconf.rb
@@ -1,3 +1,7 @@
-if have_library('iphlpapi', 'GetNetworkParams')
